{
  "id": "stadium",
  "nameEn": "Bunimovich stadium",
  "nameJa": "ブニモヴィッチ・スタジアム",
  "descriptionEn": "Rectangle [-1,1]² capped by unit semicircles. The classical billiard is ergodic and K-mixing (Bunimovich 1974); the quantum level-spacing statistics agree with GOE random matrix theory (Bohigas–Giannoni–Schmit conjecture).",
  "descriptionJa": "長方形 [-1,1]² の両端に半径 1 の半円を付加した領域。古典ビリヤードはエルゴード的かつ K 型混合 (Bunimovich 1974)；量子スペクトルの準位間隔は GOE の予想 (Bohigas–Giannoni–Schmit) に従う。",
  "category": "chaotic",
  "reference": "Bunimovich, Commun. Math. Phys. 65 (1979); Heller (1984) scars.",
